  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Copycat McRib Sandwich",
  "description": "Discover the joy of boneless baby back ribs with Chef John&#39;s clean-eating version of the McRib sandwich that&#39;s slow-baked and finished on the grill.",
  "authors": [
